{"unit_id":"ytsu-ki__dsh-relink#feature-feature-1","repo":"ytsu-ki/dsh-relink","commit":"a27635500163fc556202dca3be20bda845ec4bd0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-relink** 的功能「项目记忆自动召回」：新用户输入到达时按当前项目搜索记录，并把最多配置数量的相关内容加入上下文；无匹配或服务异常时会注明状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/dsh/recall.js:55-79","lib/memory-team.js:167-170"]}
